# Patterns here only match from the build context root unless prefixed with **/.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
# Local data, secrets and state: never part of an image.
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.dev.vars*
**/.wrangler
**/dist-worker
**/e2e/.auth
*.log
